{"id":"vod_zy360_67733","vodId":"67733","provider":"zy360","providerName":"360资源","type":2,"name":"来自风平浪静的明天","name_cn":"来自风平浪静的明天","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全26集","images":{"common":"https://www.imgzy360.com:7788/upload/vod/20241106-1/62ef3abe3c1bf2e352992da7e402ce8e.jpg"},"summary":"因为所在的波路中学倒闭，新学期一开始，先岛光（花江夏树配音）和青梅竹马向井户爱花（花泽香菜配音）以及好友比良平千咲（茅野爱衣配音）、伊佐木要（逢坂良太配音）转校至位于陆地的美滨中学继续学业。先岛和朋友们是生活在海底的海之民，传说很久以前人类全部始于大海，大有一部分人迷恋陆地的生活，而放弃了神赐予的“胞衣”。千百年来，陆之民和海之民在摩擦中共存，他们之间有矛盾，有误会，也有憧憬和向往。在新的学校，先岛和爱花结识了生活在海边的少年木原纺（石川界人饰）。来自不同的种族，少男少女别样的青春故事就此上演……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-11-06 14:38:16","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"360zy","episodes":[{"name":"第01话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241105/9n2JRgH1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241105/zzotZHJZ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241105/wnzx9ksK/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241105/g7GlG2DG/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241105/R8gWpIAn/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241105/GqVz0J8E/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241105/xfWHvwHS/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241105/uqZ0CLoa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241105/OLb2a5sR/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241105/aEeetN0F/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241105/Hu0SZxYb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241105/TgBmSZ5I/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241105/dj1LLYYU/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241105/B8mO6foT/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241105/YQh8xGMO/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16话",